cribe where places are in a city with <span class = \"strong\">prepositions of place</span> like <span class = \"italic\">near, next to, across from, between</span>  and Imperatives."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>: <span class = \"strong\">Where</span> is the drugstore?<br/><span class = \"strong\">Peter</span>: The drugstore is <span class = \"strong\">near</span> the post office."}, {"type": "text", "content": " "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class = \"strong\">Vanessa</span>: <span class = \"strong\">How</span> do we get to the dry cleaner?<br/><span class = \"strong\">Peter</span>: <span class = \"strong\">Go</span> straight ahead, and <span class = \"strong\">turn</span> right at the intersection."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"2\",\"columns\":\"3\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Place\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking for DIrections\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Giving Directions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bakery <br/> library <br/> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Where is the bakery? <br/> How do I get to the library?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The bakery is next to the library. <br/> Go straight on this street. Turn left at the lights.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about a neighborhood."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "dry cleaner"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place where someone cleans your clothes and fixes them"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Where is the dry cleaner? I need to fix this jacket."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le06ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "post office"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place where you can send letters and packages"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to go to the post office to send a letter."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le06ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "drugstore"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place to buy medicine"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Why don't you go to the drug store if you don't feel good?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le06ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hotel"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place where people pay to stay the night and can eat meals"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The restaurant in this hotel is very good."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le06ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bakery"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place to buy bread, cake"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sally always goes to the bakery to buy bread."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le06ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "deli"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a store selling prepared foods like sandwiches, salads, and drinks"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This deli has great sandwiches."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn2le06ob11aud06"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn2le06ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Draw a map of your neighborhood. Include 10 places."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Writ